In July of 2025, Sayfollah Musallet, an American citizen born and raised in Florida, was beaten to death by Israeli settlers.

No one has been punished for this crime and Sayfollah’s father wants to know why. Despite requests for a meeting, @SenRickScott of Florida refuses to sit down with the family.

@SenRickScott, we’d like to invite you to the show to explain why you won’t investigate the murder of a Floridian at the hands of Israeli settlers. You’re welcome any time.
